  "rationale": "A two-key gesture is resolved at the first release with the still-held key as the first operand. Releasing the song slot pressed first therefore copied the destination over the source, erasing it without undo. Arbitrated SEM-016 (press-order-slot-copy-only): m_grid records press order and the song page swaps the operands when the released key was pressed first. Other gestures keep release order (an existing range oracle depends on it).",
  "oracle": "README Interacting with Slots (903-904): press and hold the source slot, then the destination slot; copying an empty slot erases the target.",
